## Technology Stack Justification

### Frontend Choice (Streamlit)
- **Rapid Development**: Python-based, no JavaScript expertise required
- **Consistency**: Single language stack
- **Integration**: Native Python ecosystem integration
- **Simplicity**: Focus on functionality over complexity

### Database Choice (PostgreSQL)
- **ACID Compliance**: Reliable data handling
- **Full-Text Search**: Built-in search capabilities
- **Scalability**: Proven production performance
- **Open Source**: No licensing concerns

### Retrieval Choice (TF-IDF)
- **Interpretability**: Clear term importance scoring
- **Deterministic**: Consistent results across runs
- **Performance**: Lightweight compared to embeddings
- **Resource Efficiency**: Lower computational requirements

### Generation Choice (Ollama)
- **Privacy**: Local model deployment
- **Compatibility**: OpenAI-compatible API
- **Flexibility**: Multiple model options
- **Cost Efficiency**: No per-request fees

